        "text": "Petitioners argue that the issue before the Court is whether Secret Service agents who are prepared to take a bullet for the Vice President must also be prepared to face a retaliatory\u2011arrest lawsuit even when they have probable cause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court Record",
        "citations": [
