            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The parties appearing before the Court were Sean R. Gallagher for the petitioners, Sri Srinivasan (amicus) for the United States, and David A. Lane for the respondent."
      }
    ],
